    <briefdescription>
<para>A specialized result for the <computeroutput><ref refid="namespacellvm_1a43d65ba07f09dd4c0c13d551848cdc88" kindref="member">LoopAnalysisManagerFunctionProxy</ref></computeroutput> which retains a <computeroutput><ref refid="classllvm_1_1_loop_info" kindref="compound">LoopInfo</ref></computeroutput> reference. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This allows it to collect loop objects for which analysis results may be cached in the <computeroutput><ref refid="namespacellvm_1a58dde534a0ea2a23cb6c779c5c283f75" kindref="member">LoopAnalysisManager</ref></computeroutput>. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
